
  <sn><md>### Creating a New Remote

To create a new Rclone remote, start:

```bash
rclone config
```

Then choose:

```text
n) New remote
```

Enter:

```text
n
```

Rclone will ask:

```text
name&gt; 
```

Enter a name for your remote, for example:

```text
name&gt; gdrive
```

This creates the remote name:

```text
gdrive:
```

**Basic Process**

```text
rclone config
      ↓
      n
      ↓
Remote name
      ↓
Storage provider
      ↓
Provider-specific settings
      ↓
Authentication
      ↓
Save
```
</md></sn>
